WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.671 --> 00:00:17.739
and were in the attic putting old books into boxes.

2
00:00:19.099 --> 00:00:21.361
Their father popped his head in the door.

3
00:00:21.381 --> 00:00:23.562
"How's it going?"

4
00:00:24.103 --> 00:00:25.404
he asked cheerfully.

5
00:00:26.664 --> 00:00:30.007
He stepped into the room and began to measure a wall.

6
00:00:30.027 --> 00:00:32.901
"Dad, what are you doing?"

7
00:00:33.441 --> 00:00:34.142
asked Vinnie.

8
00:00:34.162 --> 00:00:40.347
"Just planning some changes," he replied, writing in a notebook.

9
00:00:40.367 --> 00:00:45.291
"Changes?" Mandy asked, worried.

10
00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:50.756
"The attic is going to become my new den," said Dad.

11
00:00:50.776 --> 00:00:53.078
"Your den?

12
00:00:53.698 --> 00:00:56.300
Why?" the children cried.

13
00:00:56.320 --> 00:01:02.181
"Oh, I just need a little space to myself," he explained.

14
00:01:02.201 --> 00:01:05.503
"Can't you use the basement?"

15
00:01:06.043 --> 00:01:07.845
said Vinnie, a bit rudely.

16
00:01:07.865 --> 00:01:11.927
"It's too damp down there," Dad said.

17
00:01:11.947 --> 00:01:14.369
"What's wrong with the attic?

18
00:01:14.929 --> 00:01:17.131
You're not hiding something up here, are you?"

19
00:01:17.151 --> 00:01:22.694
"Of course not, Dad," laughed Mandy.

20
00:01:23.935 --> 00:01:26.257
Dad put his notebook in his pocket.

21
00:01:26.277 --> 00:01:31.893
"Once you clear this space out, I'll start moving in," he said.

22
00:01:32.954 --> 00:01:35.596
He went downstairs, whistling happily.

23
00:01:35.616 --> 00:01:38.799
"What are we going to do?"

24
00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:40.320
asked Mandy.

25
00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:44.424
"We still have some time," said Vinnie.

26
00:01:44.444 --> 00:01:47.887
"But let's not waste another moment."

27
00:01:49.188 --> 00:01:51.170
He went and got the photo album.

28
00:01:52.692 --> 00:01:54.533
"Look, Mandy," he said.

29
00:01:56.255 --> 00:02:02.292
In the picture, the old man was standing in front of a large elm tree by a building.

30
00:02:03.633 --> 00:02:07.637
Something was sticking out of its branches on a long pole.

31
00:02:08.798 --> 00:02:09.719
It was glowing.

32
00:02:09.739 --> 00:02:14.343
"What do you think this is?"

33
00:02:15.063 --> 00:02:15.804
asked Mandy.

34
00:02:15.824 --> 00:02:18.866
"We're about to find out!"

35
00:02:19.387 --> 00:02:21.248
said Vinnie, closing his eyes.

36
00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:25.192
The children fell down the dark tunnel.

37
00:02:27.604 --> 00:02:29.486
"Ow!" cried Vinnie.

38
00:02:29.506 --> 00:02:33.249
"Oh!" yelled Mandy.

39
00:02:34.710 --> 00:02:36.872
Vinnie landed on a damp surface.

40
00:02:38.153 --> 00:02:39.675
Mandy landed nearby.

41
00:02:40.956 --> 00:02:42.737
The air smelled of the ocean.

42
00:02:43.959 --> 00:02:46.020
They were on a long, wide pier.

43
00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:48.623
"Are you okay?"

44
00:02:49.163 --> 00:02:51.165
Vinnie asked, opening his eyes.

45
00:02:51.185 --> 00:02:54.468
"Yes," Mandy answered.

46
00:02:55.944 --> 00:02:59.025
She sat up and looked around, rubbing her arm.

47
00:03:00.486 --> 00:03:02.567
The pier was in the harbor of a city.

48
00:03:03.687 --> 00:03:06.669
Brick and wooden buildings lined narrow streets.

49
00:03:07.829 --> 00:03:10.550
She could see a white church tower in the distance.

50
00:03:10.570 --> 00:03:14.912
"It looks like we're in a seaport," she said.

51
00:03:14.932 --> 00:03:17.053
"I wonder where?"

52
00:03:18.614 --> 00:03:23.076
Several tall-masted ships were tied to the pier with heavy rope.

53
00:03:24.468 --> 00:03:26.689
One ship was just coming in to dock.

54
00:03:28.429 --> 00:03:31.490
"I can see the ship's name," Mandy said.

55
00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:33.551
"The Liberty."

56
00:03:33.571 --> 00:03:36.171
Vinnie pointed.

57
00:03:36.191 --> 00:03:40.212
"It looks like the men over there are waiting for the ship."

58
00:03:41.693 --> 00:03:44.653
Suddenly, the children heard marching feet.

59
00:03:46.174 --> 00:03:47.274
They turned around.

60
00:03:48.495 --> 00:03:53.756
Soldiers wearing red coats and black hats were heading toward the ship in a line.

61
00:03:54.832 --> 00:03:56.333
They held long guns.

62
00:03:56.353 --> 00:03:59.495
"The Redcoats!"

63
00:04:00.115 --> 00:04:01.596
shouted a man on the dock.

64
00:04:02.897 --> 00:04:05.698
Everyone turned to watch the soldiers approach.

65
00:04:05.718 --> 00:04:08.039
"Who are they?"

66
00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:09.780
asked Vinnie nervously.

67
00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:12.462
"They look angry."

68
00:04:14.223 --> 00:04:17.945
The Redcoats stopped and held their weapons in front of them.

69
00:04:19.106 --> 00:04:23.068
The leader stepped forward and spoke to one of the men on the dock.

70
00:04:24.236 --> 00:04:26.818
"Vinnie! I think I know where we are!"

71
00:04:27.458 --> 00:04:28.839
Mandy almost shouted.

72
00:04:28.859 --> 00:04:30.881
"The Redcoats!

73
00:04:31.301 --> 00:04:32.962
Aren't they the British Army?"

74
00:04:34.303 --> 00:04:36.104
Vinnie stared at the soldiers.

75
00:04:36.124 --> 00:04:41.508
"Their uniforms do look familiar He paused.

76
00:04:41.528 --> 00:04:44.270
"We're still in America!"
